THIRDPARTY.yml\n  summary: An extremely fast Python package installer and resolver, written in Rust.\n  documentation: https://docs.astral.sh/uv\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - charliermarsh\n    - bollwyvl\n",
